#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in integrating quantum and high-performance computing, and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Kumuha ng pagsusulit na may 20 tanong sa IBM Training site para subukan ang iyong mga kasanayan sa pag-integrate ng quantum at high-performance computing, at makatanggap ng badge sa pamamagitan ng Credly."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Integrating quantum and high-performance computing"
msgstr "Pagsusulit | Integrating quantum and high-performance computing"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Pagsusulit at badge {#exam-and-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, intermediate level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam/badge.svg)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, intermediate level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam/badge.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Survey pagkatapos ng kurso {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Integrating quantum and high-performance computing\" course by IBM&reg;!\n"
msgstr "Maligayang bati sa pagkumpleto ng kursong \"Integrating quantum and high-performance computing\" ng IBM&reg;!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukan ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for Integrating quantum and high-performance computing.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos matapos ang mga babasahin at gawain sa kursong ito, i-click ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM Training, kung saan maaari kang kumuha ng badging exam para sa Integrating quantum and high-performance computing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagsusulit ay binubuo ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama ang hindi bababa sa 16 para makapasa. Kapag nakatanggap ng passing score, awtomatikong ipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo para mag-register sa IBM Training.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Siguraduhing handa ka na para sa pagsusulit. Kung hindi ka makatanggap ng passing score sa dalawang pagkakataon, pansamantalang mala-lock ang pagsusulit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing-badge-quiz-DL46110G\" />\n"
msgstr "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing-badge-quiz-DL46110G\" />\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "PAUNAWA: Gumagamit ang IBM ng mga serbisyo ng Credly, isang third-party na tagaproseso ng datos na awtorisado ng IBM at nakabase sa Estados Unidos, para tumulong sa pamamahala ng IBM Digital Badge program. Para maibigay sa iyo ang isang IBM Digital Badge, ang iyong personal na impormasyon (pangalan, email address, at badge na nakuha) ay ibabahagi sa Credly. Makakatanggap ka ng email notification mula sa Credly na may mga tagubilin para ma-claim ang badge. Ginagamit ang iyong personal na impormasyon para maibigay ang iyong badge at para sa pag-uulat ng programa at mga layuning operasyonal. Maaaring ibahagi ng IBM ang personal na impormasyong nakolekta sa mga subsidiary ng IBM at sa mga third party sa buong mundo. Pangangasiwaan ito nang naaayon sa mga gawi ng IBM sa privacy. Ang IBM Privacy Statement ay maaaring tingnan [dito.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
